SUMMARY:AVL International Connections - July Mix and Mingle
DESCRIPTION:AVL International Connections\nFor our **July International Mi
 x & Mingle** we will gather on the beautiful riverside deck @ New Belgium 
 Brewery (River Arts District)! If you are new\, there will be lots of folk
 s to welcome you!! If you haven't come for a few months\, come and meet so
 me new folks!\n\nWeather permitting\, we will be outside on New Belgium’
 s beautiful deck overlooking the river. If it is raining\, we’ll move in
 side to the taproom. Look for the Meetup signs and the AVL International C
 onnections' name tags. Grab a cold beverage and then join us!\n\nA local F
 ood Truck will also be out front if anyone wants a bite to eat!\n\nAs a gr
 owing group (over 1500 members)\, if you have friends that you would like 
 to bring along\, please do! Also encourage them to sign up on Meetup!
